      "schema:name": "non_global_files",
      "schema:description": "A semicolon separated list of non-shared files to be included in the dataset. The path assumes the files are located in the \"TOP/non-global/\" directory. For example, for the file is TOP/non-global/lab_processed/images/1-tissue-boundary.geojson the value of this field would be \"./lab_processed/images/1-tissue-boundary.geojson\". After ingest, these files will be copied to the appropriate locations within the respective dataset directory tree.",
