      "schema:name": "tag_enzyme_sequence",
      "schema:description": "The unique two-nucleotide barcode sequence contained within the adapter introduced by the TAG Enzyme during tagmentation. In multiplexed Paired-Tag experiments, different tag enzyme sequences are assigned to different samples or assay conditions to distinguish them and are used to demultiplex the pooled sequencing data.",
